Several descriptions are too specific:
search SECRET DOORS (also traps, hidden monsters)
loot a BOX (or a back)
read SCROLL (or book)
remove RING (or amulet)
put on RING (or amulet)

Check weapons is a strange way to describe alt-e. I would say maybe 
view/raise skills.

And a couple commands for the fighting section.

Q Quiver

Since you have f...

F Fight

Basically the opposite of m. It can comes in handy if you're fighting 
invisible nasties, or while confused and don't want to accidentally move.

